<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Bessie" data-copy-zh="Bessie">Bessie</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Ordinary Dungeon capture, cell visits and relationship activities." data-copy-zh="普通地下城捕捉、牢房探访与关系行动。">Ordinary Dungeon capture, cell visits and relationship activities.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Monster_Care_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Corridor_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_and_Recruiting_Bessie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Bessie — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/bessie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Bessie — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/bessie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Bessie — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Bessie becomes a resident of the Rose &amp; Thorn Cell Corridor after recruitment. This page covers the entrance route, cell visits and relationship activities without recounting the scenes.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>After accepting the capture offer, use the Cell Corridor to reach her assigned cell. She is available there all day after recruitment.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Build the Cell Corridor and an empty, built cell after reserved Cell 1. The currently buildable cells are 2–7. Defeat Bessie in the ordinary Dungeon; Infinity Dungeon fights neither offer capture nor increase her capture counter.</p><p>The first five victories do not roll for capture. The sixth starts at 20% plus your base Taming; each later victory adds 10 percentage points, capped at 100%. Tamer is helpful because it unlocks Taming, but the capture offer itself does not require learning that skill.</p><details><summary>Optional navigation: repeat encounter</summary><p>With the Cell Corridor built and Bessie not yet recruited, the hidden wall at floor 29, tile (1, 6), counting coordinates from 0 opens her repeat encounter. Regular encounters also occur on floors 27–35.</p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Strong Enough to Rest</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Daphne Friend (100); Bessie Friend (100); Daphne, Bessie recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Daphne +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Winner Eats Twice</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Bobo Friend (100); Bessie Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Bobo +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Warriors Measure Twice</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Myriss Friend (100); Bessie Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Myriss +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Climbing Incident</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Jelly Friend (100); Bessie Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Jelly +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Empires and Dinner</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Melanthe Friend (100); Bessie Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Melanthe +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Built to Give</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Arachne Friend (100); Bessie Friend (100); Arachne, Bessie recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Arachne +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Delicate Negotiation</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Daphne Crush (400); Bessie Crush (400); Strong Enough to Rest; Daphne, Bessie recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Daphne +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Quiet Competition</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Daphne Acquaintance (50); Myriss Acquaintance (50); Bessie Acquaintance (50); Daphne, Myriss, Bessie recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Daphne +5; Myriss +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Audience Required</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cell Corridor; Daphne Intimate (1600); Melanthe Romantic (800); Bessie Romantic (800); What Still Grows; Strong Enough to Rest; A Delicate Negotiation; Daphne, Melanthe, Bessie recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Daphne +5; Melanthe +5; Bessie +5</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Bessie</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">assigned cell; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fresh from the Source</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">assigned cell; Known (25); full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −100 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 base affection; +50 player Erotic Experience; +5 Tamed; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ride the Storm</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">assigned cell; Friend (100); full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −100 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+25 base affection; +65 player Erotic Experience; +5 Tamed; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Heart of the Herd</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">assigned cell; Crush (400); full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −100 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+40 base affection; +80 player Erotic Experience; +5 Tamed; 1/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each private cell activity also has a 1% chance to add 1 Taming when that attribute is already unlocked. Tamed progress, affection and player Erotic Experience are separate rewards. Feeding and training are handled through the monster management menu.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: relationship bonuses</summary><p>Meeting each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before the remaining relationship bonuses. The favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct one-time affection rewards are added as listed.</p><p>Strength 90; Stamina 80; Cooking 60</p><p>Favorite skill: Power Strike</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Listed time and resources are base values; applicable skills, difficulty and active bonuses can change the shown cost or affection. Base affection, direct affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>No capture offer: check ordinary-dungeon victories and a built vacant cell. A full corridor cannot accept another normal capture.</li><li>A locked later activity needs the listed relationship stage and 100 Energy; each has its own once-daily use.</li><li>Shared corridor events require the other named residents too; ordinary affection with one character does not recruit the others.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Ordinary Dungeon</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Construction and management</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-specialist-class.html">Tamer</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">Battle preparation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Monster_Care_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Corridor_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_and_Recruiting_Bessie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Bessie 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/bessie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Bessie 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/bessie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Bessie 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Bessie 招募后会居住在玫瑰与荆棘的牢房区域。这里列出加入路线、探访方式与关系行动，不复述剧情。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>接受捕捉邀请后，从牢房走廊进入系统分配给她的牢房。招募后全天可探访。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>先建好牢房走廊，并准备保留的牢房 1 之外的一间已建成空牢房。目前可建造的是牢房 2–7。在普通地下城击败 Bessie 才会推进捕捉；无限地下城既不提供捕捉，也不累计胜场。</p><p>前 5 次胜利不会进行捕捉判定；第 6 次起，概率为 20% 加上基础驯服值，之后每胜一场再加 10 个百分点，上限 100%。驯兽师会开启驯服属性，但捕捉邀请本身不要求先学会该技能。</p><details><summary>可选路线提示：重复遭遇</summary><p>已建牢房走廊且尚未招募 Bessie 时，可在普通地下城第 29 层坐标（1，6）（坐标从 0 开始）的隐藏墙触发重复遭遇。第 27–35 层也有普通遭遇。</p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">坚强，也可以休息</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Daphne 朋友 (100); Bessie 朋友 (100); Daphne, Bessie 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Daphne +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">赢家吃两份</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Bobo 朋友 (100); Bessie 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Bobo +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">战士的较量</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Myriss 朋友 (100); Bessie 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Myriss +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">攀爬事件</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Jelly 朋友 (100); Bessie 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Jelly +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">帝国与晚餐</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Melanthe 朋友 (100); Bessie 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Melanthe +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">能屈亦能撑</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Arachne 朋友 (100); Bessie 朋友 (100); Arachne, Bessie 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Arachne +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一场温柔的协商</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Daphne 迷恋 (400); Bessie 迷恋 (400); 坚强，也可以休息; Daphne, Bessie 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Daphne +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安静比赛</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Daphne 相识 (50); Myriss 相识 (50); Bessie 相识 (50); Daphne, Myriss, Bessie 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Daphne +5; Myriss +5; Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不需要观众</th><td data-label="条件">牢房走廊; Daphne 亲密 (1600); Melanthe 浪漫感 (800); Bessie 浪漫感 (800); 仍在生长的事物; 坚强，也可以休息; 一场温柔的协商; Daphne, Melanthe, Bessie 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Daphne +5; Melanthe +5; Bessie +5</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与 Bessie 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">分配的牢房; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 3次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">源头新鲜</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">分配的牢房; 已知 (25); 完整版</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −100 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">基础好感度 +10；玩家情欲经验 +50；驯服度 +5；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">驾驭风暴</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">分配的牢房; 朋友 (100); 完整版</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −100 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">基础好感度 +25；玩家情欲经验 +65；驯服度 +5；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">牛群之心</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">分配的牢房; 迷恋 (400); 完整版</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −100 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">基础好感度 +40；玩家情欲经验 +80；驯服度 +5；1次/日</td></tr></tbody></table><p>牢房私人行动还各有 1% 概率增加 1 驯服，前提是你已开启该属性。驯服度、好感度和玩家情欲经验是三种不同奖励。喂养与训练请使用怪物管理菜单。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：关系加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。标为直接好感度的一次性奖励按表中数值加入。</p><p>力量 90; 耐力 80; 烹饪 60</p><p>偏好技能：强力打击</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。表中耗时与资源为基础值；适用技能、难度及当前加成可能改变界面显示的消耗或好感度。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家情欲经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>没有捕捉邀请时，先确认普通地下城胜场，以及是否有已建成的空牢房。牢房已满时无法接收新的普通捕捉对象。</li><li>后续行动要求对应关系阶段与 100 精力，各行动每天分别可用一次。</li><li>共同牢房事件也要求其他指定住民已加入；只提升一人的好感度不会自动招募其他人。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">普通地下城</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">建设与管理</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-specialist-class.html">驯兽师</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">战斗准备</a></li></ul></section>
